<view class="page-broadcast">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="form-item">
      <text class="form-label">消息标题</text>
      <input class="form-input" placeholder="默认：平台通知" value="{{title}}" bindinput="onTitleInput" maxlength="30" />
    </view>
    <view class="form-item">
      <text class="form-label">消息内容 <text class="required">*</text></text>
      <textarea class="form-textarea" placeholder="请输入要群发给所有用户的消息内容" value="{{content}}" bindinput="onContentInput" maxlength="500" />
      <text class="form-tip">{{content.length}}/500</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="broadcast-info">
    <text>群发后，所有注册用户的消息中心都会收到该通知，底部导航栏会显示未读角标。</text>
  </view>

  <button class="btn-primary submit-btn" bindtap="submit">确认群发</button>
</view>